0 -14 Td
(A multi-threaded server is preferred because each client can be handled without) Tj
0 -14 Td
(blocking others. In a single-threaded design, one slow client operation can) Tj
0 -14 Td
(delay all remaining clients and reduce responsiveness.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(When many clients communicate at the same time, common challenges include) Tj
0 -14 Td
(shared-state synchronization, ordering of broadcasts, client disconnect) Tj
0 -14 Td
(handling, and avoiding race conditions in message/event logs.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
(TCP reliability comes from connection-oriented state, sequence numbers,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(acknowledgments, retransmissions, and in-order delivery guarantees. For chat,) Tj
0 -14 Td
(this means messages are delivered reliably and without corruption at the) Tj
0 -14 Td
(application layer.) Tj
0 -14 Td
() Tj
0 -14 Td
