0 -14 Td
(application-data packets \(`PSH,ACK`\), server-to-client broadcast packets, and) Tj
0 -14 Td
(connection termination \(`FIN,ACK`\). These packet-level observations matched the) Tj
0 -14 Td
(server/client runtime behavior and log timelines.) Tj
